        <section id="scope" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-4">
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-bone sm:text-3xl">1. Who this Policy covers</h2>
            <p>This Policy applies to websites, applications, checkout pages, invoices, payment links, portals and digital products operated by <strong>Techibytes Media LLC</strong> that link to it.</p>
            <p>Techibytes is a full-service software development and digital marketing agency that also builds and operates digital products. Depending on the Service, we may handle information for our own operations or on behalf of a client or business using our technology. Merchants and payment providers may also have their own privacy notices.</p>
