            <p>Our Services may use cookies and similar technology for sign-in, preferences, analytics, security and payment fraud prevention. You can control optional cookies through available controls or your browser, although essential features may stop working.</p>
            <p>We may send account, security, support and transaction messages. You can unsubscribe from promotional emails, but you will still receive important service messages.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="retention" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-4">
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-bone sm:text-3xl">7. Retention and security</h2>
            <p>We keep information only as long as reasonably needed to provide the Services, maintain transaction and dispute records, prevent fraud and meet legal or accounting requirements. When it is no longer needed, we delete, anonymize or securely restrict it.</p>
            <p>We use reasonable safeguards such as access controls, encryption in transit, secure payment-provider integrations, backups and monitoring. No online system is completely secure, so please protect your login details and tell us promptly about suspected unauthorized access.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="rights" class="scroll-mt-28 space-y-4">
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-bone sm:text-3xl">8. Your privacy rights</h2>
            <p>Depending on your location, you may ask to access, correct, delete or restrict your information; object to certain uses; withdraw consent; receive eligible data in a portable format; or request review of certain automated decisions.</p>
            <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@techibytesmedia.com" class="font-semibold text-accent underline decoration-accent/30 underline-offset-4">support@techibytesmedia.com</a> with the Service and information involved. We may need to verify your identity or, when another client, merchant or provider controls the information, help direct your request to the appropriate organization.</p>
            <p>If you have a privacy concern, please contact us first so we can review and address it. Depending on where you live, applicable privacy laws may also give you the right to make a complaint.</p>
        </section>

